---
layout: base
---

<header>
  <h1>Paulo Henrique Cuchi</h1>

  <blockquote>
    <em>
      I'm a software engineer who likes to delete code more than I like to
      write it.

      This is the place I might share anything I find both interesting and
      relevant.

      I don't post as much as I would expect.
    </em>
  </blockquote>
</header>

<main>
  <section>
    <h3>Things I like</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Backend web development</li>
      <li>Technical leadership and mentorship</li>
      <li>DevOps culture, processes &amp; tools</li>
      <li>Unix-based tools and systems, either using or developing them</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>Posts</h3>
    <ul>
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
        — <span class="date-detail">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>My career</h3>
    <div class="career-timeline">
    {% for event in career %}
      <div class="career-item"{% if event.isCurrent %} data-current{% endif %}>
        <div class="career-meta">
          {{ event.displayBegin }} – {{ event.displayEnd }} · <span class="career-duration">{{ event.duration }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="career-card">
          <div class="career-header">
            {% if event.logoUrl %}
            <img src="{{ event.logoUrl }}" alt="{{ event.where }}" class="career-logo" loading="lazy">
            {% endif %}
            <div>
              <strong>{{ event.where }}</strong>
              <div>{{ event.title }} · {{ event.type }}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% if event.activities and event.activities.length %}
          <ul class="career-activities">
          {% for activity in event.activities %}
            <li>{{ activity }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>


</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="social-links">
    <a href="https://github.com/cuchi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">
      <img alt="GitHub" src="/assets/images/github.png" class="social-icon">
    </a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pcuchi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link">
      <img alt="LinkedIn" src="/assets/images/linkedin.png" class="social-icon">
    </a>
    <a href="/rss.xml" class="social-link">
      <img alt="RSS" src="/assets/images/rss.png" class="social-icon">
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="footer-text">
    This website is an open source project under the Apache 2.0 license. You can find all the source code
    <a href="https://github.com/cuchi/website" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here</a>.
  </p>
</footer>
